.TH focusforge-cli-cache 1  "cache 0.1.0-rc.1" 
.SH NAME
focusforge\-cli\-cache \- Remove every entry from the stage cache under `.scratch/stage\-cache/`. Never touches `.scratch/resume/` or any project
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfocusforge\-cli cache\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-v \fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove every entry from the stage cache under `.scratch/stage\-cache/`. Never touches `.scratch/resume/` or any project
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit the JSON report instead of human\-readable text
.TP
\fB\-v\fR
Increase log detail (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Log errors only
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
focusforge\-cli\-cache\-clear(1)
Remove every entry from the stage cache
.TP
focusforge\-cli\-cache\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0-rc.1
